  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in the pressure cooker over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Stir in the smoked paprika, tomato paste, and rehydrated dried shrimp.",
    "Add the brown rice and chicken broth to the pressure cooker.",
    "Close the lid and cook on high pressure for 10 minutes.",
    "Let the pressure release naturally for 10 minutes, then quick-release any remaining pressure.",
    "Fluff the pilaf with a fork and serve hot."
